    rdf:value """Tuesday, Apr. 9, 1907
London.
Karin dreadfully ill, and so sick with the chloroform. Ray came up to be with me in the flat.
Bernhard at Perugia. Saw exhibition and met its organizer, the Marchesa Torrelli."""^^xsd:string ;
